thub.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0567.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0553","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1187","title":"Microsoft Internet Explorer IFrame/Frame 跨站脚本执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5.01 至 6.0 存在跨域帧脚本执行漏洞。当 IE 窗口打开属于不同域或安全区域的子窗口时，浏览器安全机制未能有效阻止父窗口访问子窗口内的 frame 或 iframe 元素。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可构造恶意网页，通过将子窗口中 frame 或 iframe 的 URL 设置为 javascript: 协议并附带任意脚本代码的方式，在受限的安全区域或域上下文中执行任意 JavaScript 代码，从而读取和执行本地系统文件，甚至可在 \"My Computer\" 安全区域内执行脚本。攻击者只需诱导用户访问包含恶意代码的网页即可触发该漏洞，可导致敏感信息泄露及本地代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.8,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1187"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:54Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-047 累积安全补丁（知识库文章 Q323759），该补丁修复了 Internet Explorer 5.01、5.5 及 6.0 中通过 frame/iframe 元素及 JavaScript 跨域执行本地脚本的漏洞。对于 Windows 2000 系统，确保 IE 5.01 已安装 Service Pack 2 或更高版本；对于 IE 5.5，需安装 Service Pack 1 或 Service Pack 2；IE 6.0 则需安装 Gold 版本补丁。补丁安装后需重启系统，验证方式为在 IE 中打开\"帮助\"→\"关于 Internet Explorer\"，确认 Q323759 已出现在更新版本列表中。若无法立即安装补丁，建议将已知不可信网站添加到\"受限站点区域\"，并在该区域禁用 ActiveX 脚本和 Java 小程序作为临时缓解措施；同时升级到 Internet Explorer 6.0 Service Pack 1 或更新版本的浏览器，以获得包含此修复的完整累积更新。由于该浏览器版本已停止支持，最彻底的解决方案是迁移至 Microsoft Edge 或其他受支持的现代浏览器。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103158601431054&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10066.php","http://www.osvdb.org/2998","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5672","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-066","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A203","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A225","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21777","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1187.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1187.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1187.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1187.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1187","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1187.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1187.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1187.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1187.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2002/CVE-2002-1187.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0552","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1183","title":"Microsoft Windows 数字证书校验远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Internet Explorer 5/6、Konqueror 2.2.2/3.0 及 Weblogic Server 5/6/7 等产品在处理 X.509 数字证书链时未正确验证 Basic Constraints 扩展字段，导致远程攻击者可通过构造特制的无效证书链欺骗客户端或服务器对证书有效性的校验，实现身份伪造。该漏洞影响 Windows 98、Windows NT 4.0 等系统，攻击者无需身份认证即可在远程向目标发送恶意签发的证书，利用证书验证缺陷执行任意代码或进行中间人攻击，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。建议用户及时安装厂商安全更新以修复证书校验逻辑。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1183"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:53Z","remediation":"安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-050 对应补丁 Q329115（2002 年 11 月 20 日修订版），受影响系统包括 Windows 98/98SE/Me、Windows NT 4.0 及终端服务器版、Windows 2000、Windows XP；Windows 2000 SP4 用户若已安装 Internet Explorer 6.0 SP1，须额外安装 2003 年 11 月更新的 SP4 安全补丁。Mac 产品（Microsoft Office、Internet Explorer for Mac、Outlook Express for Mac）须分别下载对应平台独立补丁，不可通用。安装后重启系统，Windows 平台可通过注册表路径 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Updates\\ 下对应版本目录验证 Q329115 是否成功安装，Windows 98/NT 4.0 可使用 Qfecheck.exe 工具确认。如暂时无法打补丁，应在所有网络通信中手动核验数字证书链的 Basic Constraints 字段，拒绝任何自签名或来源不明的证书，并密切监控 CryptoAPI 调用的异常行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5410","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-050","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9776","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1059","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1455","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2108","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21692","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cbc8909f965784fa84e604f999ad78ba1a862d6c/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1183","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c9ca0c7ecb65f7366b1a83938dcd1c80cf9c2d0e/2002/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/8e09cd003036511dff025515f28920f1d343007b/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1183.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1183.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1183.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0552.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0331","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0331.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1320","title":"华盛顿大学 Pine 堆溢出远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Pine 4.44 及更早版本在处理邮件头部的 From 字段时存在堆内存破坏漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证，只需向目标用户发送一封包含大量连续双引号字符的 From 头部电子邮件，即可触发 Pine 邮件客户端在解析该头部时发生堆损坏，导致程序崩溃并产生核心转储且重启失败，从而造成拒绝服务。根据 SecurityFocus 分析，该漏洞理论上存在执行任意代码的可能性。该漏洞影响运行 Pine 4.x 系列邮件客户端的 Linux/Unix 系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1320"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pine 至 4.44 以上版本。Red Hat Linux 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:270/RHSA-2002:271 提供的更新包；Mandrake 用户安装 MDKSA-2002:084 更新；Conectiva 用户安装公告 000551 对应更新。如无法升级，可在邮件服务器或 MTA 层面过滤 From 头中大量连续引号字符的畸形邮件作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000551","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103668430620531&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103884988306241&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10555.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-084.php","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/engarde_advisory-2614.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_046_pine.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-270.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-271.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6120","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21985","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1320.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9e1d600240836820e3a1b1e4977c0af8cbdc05f2/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1320","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6604e71750f28c1fc12ae269817332f21f2b9d84/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f633ee26df31c8f5776009de314413a57041bf98/2002/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7e55a51637777fc04c5ee78af002f3381c04b9ec/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1320.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1320.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1320.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0331.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0330","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0330.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1319","title":"Linux 内核 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 2.4.20 及更早版本以及 2.5.x 版本在 x86 系统上运行时，其仿真模式未能正确清除 TF（陷阱标志）和 NT（嵌套任务）EFLAGS 标志位，导致本地用户可通过触发仿真模式导致系统挂起，造成拒绝服务攻击。该漏洞影响 x86 架构下的 Linux 内核 2.4.20 及更早版本以及 2.5.x 开发版本，攻击者需具备本地用户权限即可利用，通过触发仿真模式使系统挂起，导致拒绝服务，CVSS 评分 2.1（低危），主要影响系统可用性。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1319"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:06Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核到 2.4.21 或更高版本，或升级到已修补的 2.5.x 稳定版本（如 2.5.45 及以上）。Red Hat 用户可安装 RHSA-2002:267 补丁，Debian 用户可升级至 kernel-image-2.4.21 或更高版本。若暂时无法升级内核，可通过限制本地用户登录权限、禁用不必要的本地账户或在内核启动参数中禁用 VM86 模拟模式作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000553","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103714004623587&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103737292709297&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-262.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-264.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-263.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6115","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10576","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1319","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a611a7d397ce100357a922cf54bc17349e089319/2002/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1319.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1319.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1319.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0330.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0330.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0067","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0067.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1336","title":"TightVNC 远程桌面 VNC 认证绕过漏洞","description":"TightVNC 1.2.6 之前版本存在安全绕过漏洞。该漏洞的根源在于 TightVNC 在处理多个客户端连接时，为所有连接生成相同的挑战字符串（challenge string）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可以通过嗅探网络流量获取其他用户与服务器之间的挑战和响应数据，利用这些窃取的信息绕过 VNC 身份验证机制，无需知道目标用户的密码即可建立 VNC 连接并控制远程桌面。该漏洞影响所有运行 TightVNC 1.2.6 之前版本的 Windows、Linux 等操作系统上的 TightVNC 服务端，攻击者只要能够监听服务器与客户端之间的网络通信即可实施攻击，利用条件简单且无需特殊权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1336"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:07Z","remediation":"立即升级到 TightVNC 1.2.6 或更高版本，该版本修复了重复使用相同质询字符串导致的认证绕过漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙中限制 VNC 端口（默认 5900/TCP）仅允许可信 IP 访问，或强制通过 SSH 隧道加密传输 VNC 流量，以防止攻击者嗅探网络中的认证质询与响应数据。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000640","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102753170201524&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=102769183913594&w=2","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2003:022","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-287.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-041.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5296","http://www.tightvnc.com/WhatsNew.txt","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5992","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1c8487d39144bddd392ea8e64c19d3184e53aad1/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1336","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/b858c1de67d8192aba338799e4dc25fc6df3edc6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c1096ae2c739fb24857b16bf09f0fefbd8cfadc2/2002/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b50573b11cc979cd742f854e751c69c1ee415eb0/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1336.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/9c3e0172b371d5efbbab50ce0cd0aa5c9ed664c4/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1336.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1336.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0067.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0066","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1335","title":"w3m HTML标签跨站脚本漏洞","description":"w3m 0.3.2 存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，在渲染框架（frame）中的 HTML 标签时未进行适当的转义处理。远程攻击者可构造包含恶意脚本或 HTML 的页面，当用户访问该页面时，脚本将在浏览器上下文中执行，从而获取用户的文件或 Cookie 信息。该漏洞影响 w3m 0.3.2 及之前版本，攻击条件为受害者需访问攻击者构造的恶意网页，利用方式为诱导用户点击或访问嵌入恶意内容的页面。CVSS 评分为 4.3，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.3,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1335"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:07Z","remediation":"升级到 w3m 0.3.2.1 或更高版本，该版本修复了 frame 内容未正确转义 HTML 标签导致的跨站脚本漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙或代理层面过滤恶意网页内容，或暂时避免使用 w3m 浏览不可信站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://mi.med.tohoku.ac.jp/~satodai/w3m-dev-en/200211.month/838.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/8015","http://secunia.com/advisories/8016","http://secunia.com/advisories/8031","http://secunia.com/advisories/8053","http://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=124484","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-249","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-250","http://www.debian.org/security/2003/dsa-251","http://www.openpkg.com/security/advisories/OpenPKG-SA-2003.009.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6981","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-044.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-045.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6793","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10842","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c5cb8015669b7fea66cc41d203b97a12e61abfc/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1335","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be04a74d8eb7583856274b2516ee1145cf8d4218/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7fec49e4355e166a4b0625e0b5eb4d2c8efa124/2002/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/387709ab0226578f568bf79a76d7e3ca05d5c97a/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1335.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/9c3e0172b371d5efbbab50ce0cd0aa5c9ed664c4/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1335.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1335.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0065","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0065.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1323","title":"Perl Safe.pm 沙箱逃逸漏洞","description":"Safe.pm 是 Perl 语言中用于创建安全沙箱（safe compartment）以执行不可信代码的模块。该漏洞存在于 Safe.pm 2.0.7 及更早版本中，且仅在 Perl 5.8.0 及更早版本环境下触发。攻击者可在 safe compartment 内重新定义子例程参数变量 @_，由于该变量在 Safe::reval 和 Safe::rdo 的连续调用之间未得到正确重置，攻击者可借此突破沙箱限制，执行原本受限制的代码操作。该漏洞影响所有使用旧版 Safe.pm 运行不可信 Perl 脚本的系统环境。攻击者需具备在沙箱中执行 Perl 代码的权限，并利用 @_ 变量的重新定义逐步逃逸安全边界，从而可能导致权限提升或数据泄露。RedHat 将其定级为中等危险。升级至 Safe.pm 更新版本可修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1323"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-12-11T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:06Z","remediation":"立即升级 Perl 至 5.8.0-14 或更高版本（Debian unstable/woody），该版本包含 Safe.pm 2.0.8 修复补丁，修复了 Safe::reval 和 Safe::rdo 中因 @_ 变量未重置导致的沙箱逃逸漏洞。若无法立即升级，可在 Perl 配置中禁用 Safe::reval 和 Safe::rdo 的使用，或在应用层对用户输入进行严格过滤，防止攻击者通过重定义 @_ 变量突破沙箱隔离。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0061.html","http://bugs6.perl.org/rt2/Ticket/Display.html?id=17744","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104005919814869&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104033126305252&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104040175522502&w=2","http://use.perl.org/articles/02/10/06/1118222.shtml?tid=5","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-208","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10574.php","http://www.osvdb.org/2183","http://www.osvdb.org/3814","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-256.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-257.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6111","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1160","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1323.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1323","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1323.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/c19e03a3f5c73c1254957c1cd474626aa25ecdd7/2002/CVE-2002-1323.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1323.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1323.json","https://github.com/CPAN-Security/cpan-advisory-database/blob/bc9ed2336eeed09f48acb0a64fd37970dc5a31d6/triage/CVE-2002-1323.yml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1323.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5f