/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A1467","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2002/CVE-2002-1318.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9733cd108933bea779970cc29981361e50691314/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1318","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/54f83abc415bbb86c58c9eb7678aadf276fc79d6/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/32432109ff9e86b2bb98b1a1db62e571ca6165c8/2002/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ad5644ee4d6d235ae1cfa1878af1fb901c8393c9/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1318.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/cc31a434e24cc02a2538d6715dca3a7fe963ede8/config/msf_cve-db.txt","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1318.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1318.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0064.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0558","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0558.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1220","title":"ISC BIND 8.3.x OPT记录大UDP载荷拒绝服务漏洞","description":"ISC BIND 8.3.x 至 8.3.3 版本存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向 DNS 服务器发送包含超大 UDP 负载的 OPT 资源记录（EDNS0）的特定子域名查询请求，触发断言失败导致 BIND 进程异常终止，造成服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，影响运行上述版本 BIND 的 DNS 服务器系统。ExploitDB 已公开 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1220"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:57Z","remediation":"升级 ISC BIND 至 8.3.4 或更高版本（8.3.x 系列已停止维护，建议迁移至 BIND 9.x 系列）。如无法立即升级，可在防火墙或网络边界限制对 DNS 服务器的外部访问，仅允许可信源发起 DNS 查询，并限制 UDP 大包通过以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bvlive01.iss.net/issEn/delivery/xforce/alertdetail.jsp?oid=21469","http://lists.apple.com/archives/Security-announce/2002/Nov/msg00000.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103713117612842&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103763574715133&w=2","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4999","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/300019","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-31.html","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-013.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-196","http://www.isc.org/products/BIND/bind-security.html","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/229595","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-077.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6161","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10332","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A449","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/22011","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/90ce235668535187d033418a98446c7a08506c82/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1220","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/eef981a35a6293dd42587dac1f9be4de4ae1256e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/fb4a6b1b054a1fd4a892f5260545dddbd2342f5a/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1220.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d6ca921ab16ef1f62d93ae6c66f1b85dd0b881a9/2002/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/c6e457224984003aac7610b750677033fb679879/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1220.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1220.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0558.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0558.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0544","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0544.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1142","title":"Microsoft MDAC RDS DataStub 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Data Access Components (MDAC) 的远程数据服务 (RDS) 组件中的 msadcs.dll 存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 IIS 服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求（包含超长 Content-Type 头）到 Data Stub 处理程序，触发堆缓冲区溢出，从而在目标系统上以 IUSR_<计算机名> 账户权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 MDAC 2.1 至 2.6 版本及 Internet Explorer 5.01 至 6.0，Microsoft 已在 MS02-065 安全公告中发布补丁修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1142"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:48Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS02-065 提供的补丁 (Q329414)，或升级 MDAC 至 2.7 及以上版本（Windows XP 自带版本不受影响）。对于无法立即打补丁的 IIS 服务器，可使用 IIS Lockdown Tool 禁用 RDS 组件，或部署 URLScan 工具限制非 ASCII 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vulnwatch/2002-q4/0082.html","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2002-33.html","http://www.foundstone.com/knowledge/randd-advisories-display.html?id=337","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/542081","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6214","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2002/ms02-065","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10659","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10669","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A2730","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A294","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A3573","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19026","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2002/CVE-2002-1142.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1142.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1142.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1142","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1142.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1142.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1142.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1142.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/e2cba2a029d0a53c95f0000f5eb42e0eb69717b8/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1142.md","https://github.com/e-m-b-a/emba/blob/7b0091a6728c321d97febad01bf502be7a113020/config/msf_cve-db.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0544.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2002/EXP-AVE-2002-0544.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0544.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0327","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0327.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1308","title":"Mozilla Firefox 堆缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Netscape 和 Mozilla 浏览器在处理 jar: URL 引用的 .jar 文件时，解压缩过程中存在堆缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可构造包含畸形 .jar 文件的恶意 jar: URL，诱导用户访问或自动加载，触发解压缩时的堆缓冲区溢出，实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Netscape 及早期 Mozilla 版本浏览器，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），攻击向量为网络远程、低复杂度、无需认证，成功利用可导致任意代码执行，攻击者可完全控制受害主机。攻击条件为用户访问包含恶意 jar: URL 的页面或邮件，利用方式为构造畸形 JAR 文件触发堆溢出实现代码执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1308"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:05Z","remediation":"升级到 Netscape Navigator 4.79 或 Mozilla 1.7.12 或更高版本，更新 NSS/NSPR 安全补丁至 ≥2006-03-01，更新安全库 NSS 3.28.4+ 以修复缓冲区溢出漏洞。如需立即修复，可在浏览器中禁用 jar: 协议或限制 jar 文件处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=157646","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103730181813075&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-162.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-163.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6185","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/10636","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1308","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/7f52f1c038fbedc0ce9132a21fb74a8989887ee3/2002/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/9413a774aa3c18bbfa82e1c5748c45ab31f77f67/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1308.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1308.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1308.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0327.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0325","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0325.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1306","title":"KDE LISa 缓冲区溢出代码执行漏洞","description":"KDE LISa 守护进程存在多个缓冲区溢出漏洞，影响 KDE 2.x 2.1 及后续版本、KDE 3.x 3.0.4 之前版本。攻击者可通过向 lisa 守护进程发送特制数据，或诱导用户访问恶意构造的 \"lan://\" URL 触发漏洞，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞可被本地攻击者利用提升权限，亦可被远程攻击者在无需身份认证的情况下通过网络触发，CVSS 评分 7.5（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），影响机密性、完整性和可用性。建议升级至 KDE 3.0.4 或更高版本修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1306"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:05Z","remediation":"升级 KDE 到 3.0.4 或更高版本（已修复 LISa 守护进程缓冲区溢出）。若暂时无法升级，建议停用并禁用 lisa 守护进程（通过系统服务管理器或删除 /etc/init.d/lisa 启动脚本），并在防火墙层面阻断相关端口访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103712329102632&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103728981029342&w=2","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/n-020.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-214","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10597.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10598.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021111-2.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-080.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_042_kdenetwork.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1306","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/e792980cc94f389630bc2f069d30ea05c8ae92bd/2002/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/9413a774aa3c18bbfa82e1c5748c45ab31f77f67/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1306.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1306.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-13xx/CVE-2002-1306.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0325.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0324","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0324.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1282","title":"KDE telnet KIO 子系统 代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞位于 KDE 2.x 的 telnet 协议处理子系统（KIO 组件中的 telnet.protocol）。攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的 URL 利用此漏洞，在本地或远程执行任意恶意代码。此安全问题影响 KDE 2.1 及后续所有版本，存在于 telnet 协议实现中对 URL 参数的验证不足，允许攻击者绕过安全控制，通过 KIO 子系统获取对目标系统的未授权访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1282"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-11-29T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:59:03Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 KDE 至 2.2.2 或更高版本（或升级至 KDE 3.x 系列），该版本已修复 telnet KIO 子系统的任意代码执行漏洞。若无法立即升级，请在系统防火墙层面禁止 telnet:// 协议处理，或在 KDE 控制中心禁用 telnet KIO 模块（kcontrol → 网络 → 协议 → 禁用 telnet），并限制本地用户对 telnet.protocol 文件的执行权限（chmod 000 /usr/lib/kde2/telnet.protocol）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103712550205730&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103728981029342&w=2","http://secunia.com/advisories/8298","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-204","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10603.php","http://www.kde.org/info/security/advisory-20021111-1.txt","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-079.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-220.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/6182","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1282","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09110e63eff2c5d8130d6d56a8e64068489b359a/2002/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ddaa78c50e489d89917c344923ee56bc36e3235e/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1282.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/ff131139bd19bf58727d5c9cd0ead10532e0bef5/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1282.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-12xx/CVE-2002-1282.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0324.toml"}]